[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950112788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-2950112788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106987","id":2950112788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v1yYU","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T18:30:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T05:38:25Z","body":"Discovered more bugs:\r\n- When hovering over the middle of a named lambda name, the tooltip is shown only for `@GDScript` functions.\r\n- When hovering over the left edge of a named lambda name, the tooltip is shown for `native`, `@GDScript`, `@GlobalScope`, and local functions.\r\n  - The GDScript parser is incorrect. Reported in \r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117305.\r\n- When hovering over the middle of a function name, the tooltip is shown only for `native` and `@GDScript` functions.\r\n- When hovering over the left edge of a function name, the tooltip is shown only for `native` and `@GDScript` functions.\r\n\r\nEdit: Fixed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950112788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4036308010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-4036308010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106987","id":4036308010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wlSwq","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T04:36:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T04:36:14Z","body":"Thanks for removing the 29 extra team reviews, not sure what happened there...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4036308010/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4043074186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-4043074186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106987","id":4043074186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7w_GqK","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T00:26:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T18:14:58Z","body":"Below is a full summary of what this PR fixed:\r\n```gdscript\r\n@warning_ignore_start(\"unused_parameter\", \"unused_variable\", \"unused_signal\", \"untyped_declaration\", \"inferred_declaration\")\r\n\r\nclass_name ceil # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nclass floor extends Node: # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\tfunc f() -> void:\r\n\t\tpass\r\n\r\nvar sin = 111 # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\nconst cos = 222 # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\r\n# Named enum keys do not shadow anything, because they can only be accessed as NamedEnum.KEY.\r\n\r\nenum max { # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\tmin = 333 # No warning as expected.\r\n}\r\n\r\nenum {\r\n\tclamp,       # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\tclampi = 444 # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n}\r\n\r\n# Note: Signal parameters do not shadow anything.\r\n\r\nsignal sqrt # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\r\nsignal s(pow) # No warning.\r\n\r\n#func get(_property: StringName) -> Variant: # (NATIVE_METHOD_OVERRIDE)\r\n\t#return -1\r\n\r\nfunc char(code :int): # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\treturn -1\r\n\r\nfunc log(x: float): # Missing warning. <-- Fixed! Now warns (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\treturn -1\r\n\r\nfunc unique(log: float): # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\treturn -1\r\n\r\nfunc unique2(...log): # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\treturn -1\r\n\r\n# Note: Named lambdas do not shadow anything.\r\n\r\n# No warning as expected.\r\nvar named_lambda_1 = func get():\r\n\treturn null\r\n\r\n# No warning as expected.\r\nvar named_lambda_2 = func char():\r\n\treturn null\r\n\r\n# No warning as expected.\r\nvar named_lambda_3 = func log():\r\n\treturn null\r\n\r\nvar named_lambda_4 = func unique():\r\n\treturn null\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar sinh = 1 # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\t\r\n\tfor char in []: # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\t\tpass\r\n\t\r\n\tvar k = 1\r\n\tmatch k:\r\n\t\tvar abs: # (SHADOWED_GLOBAL_IDENTIFIER)\r\n\t\t\tpass\r\n\t\r\n\t# The new warnings are consistent with how GDScript is parsed.\r\n\r\n\tprint(sin) # Prints 111\r\n\tprint(cos) # Prints 222\r\n\tprint(max) # Prints { \"min\": 333 }\r\n\tprint(min) # Prints @GlobalScope::min\r\n\tprint(max.min) # Prints 333\r\n\tprint(clamp) # Prints 0\r\n\tprint(clampi) # Prints 444\r\n\tprint(ceil) # Prints (res://main.gd):<GDScript#-9223372002226600493>\r\n\tprint(floor) # Prints ():<GDScript#-9223372002042051115>\r\n\tprint(sqrt) # Prints Node(main.gd)::[signal]sqrt\r\n\tprint(s) # Prints Node(main.gd)::[signal]s\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4043074186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4043102004","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-4043102004","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106987","id":4043102004,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7w_Nc0","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T00:35:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T18:16:56Z","body":"> class_name ceil # Missing warning. <-- Too complex to fix in this PR.\r\n\r\nFixing this ~(in the future)~ will require changing `GDScriptAnalyzer::is_shadowing()`, since it detects the current script's `class_name` as a global identifier.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4043102004/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4820013657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-4820013657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106987","id":4820013657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH0uSWQ","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T18:18:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T18:18:16Z","body":"Rebased after `4.7.stable`. Updated [test script](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106987#issuecomment-4043074186).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4820013657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0